## 📌 What You Will Learn

- String functions — UPPER, LOWER, LENGTH, CONCAT, TRIM, SUBSTRING, REPLACE, LEFT, RIGHT, LPAD
- Date functions — NOW, CURDATE, YEAR, MONTH, DAY, EXTRACT, DATE_FORMAT
- DATEDIFF — days between two dates
- DATE_ADD & DATE_SUB — add or subtract time
- TIMESTAMPDIFF — difference in any unit
- Combining string and date functions in real queries

