## 📝 Quick Reference

### String Functions

| Function | What It Does | Example |
|---|---|---|
| `UPPER(str)` | Convert to uppercase | `UPPER('rahul')` → `RAHUL` |
| `LOWER(str)` | Convert to lowercase | `LOWER('RAHUL')` → `rahul` |
| `LENGTH(str)` | Count characters | `LENGTH('Rahul')` → `5` |
| `CONCAT(a,b)` | Join strings | `CONCAT('Rahul',' ','Sharma')` → `Rahul Sharma` |
| `CONCAT_WS(sep,a,b)` | Join with separator | `CONCAT_WS(' ','Rahul','Sharma')` → `Rahul Sharma` |
| `TRIM(str)` | Remove spaces both sides | `TRIM(' Rahul ')` → `Rahul` |
| `SUBSTRING(str,pos,len)` | Extract part of string | `SUBSTRING('Rahul',1,3)` → `Rah` |
| `REPLACE(str,from,to)` | Swap text | `REPLACE('gmail','gmail','yahoo')` |
| `LEFT(str,n)` | First n characters | `LEFT('Rahul',3)` → `Rah` |
| `RIGHT(str,n)` | Last n characters | `RIGHT('Rahul',3)` → `hul` |
| `LPAD(str,len,pad)` | Pad from left | `LPAD(7,6,'0')` → `000007` |
| `LOCATE(sub,str)` | Find position | `LOCATE('@','r@g.com')` → `2` |

---

### Date & Time Functions

| Function | What It Does | Example Output |
|---|---|---|
| `NOW()` | Current date + time | `2024-04-30 14:35:22` |
| `CURDATE()` | Current date only | `2024-04-30` |
| `YEAR(date)` | Extract year | `2024` |
| `MONTH(date)` | Extract month number | `4` |
| `MONTHNAME(date)` | Extract month name | `April` |
| `DAY(date)` | Extract day | `30` |
| `DAYNAME(date)` | Extract day name | `Tuesday` |
| `EXTRACT(part FROM date)` | Extract any part | `EXTRACT(QUARTER FROM date)` |
| `DATE_FORMAT(date, fmt)` | Format for display | `05 January 2024` |
| `DATEDIFF(end, start)` | Days between dates | `120` |
| `DATE_ADD(date, INTERVAL n unit)` | Add to date | `2024-02-04` |
| `DATE_SUB(date, INTERVAL n unit)` | Subtract from date | `2024-01-24` |
| `TIMESTAMPDIFF(unit, start, end)` | Diff in any unit | months, years, days |

---

### DATE_FORMAT Codes

| Code | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| `%Y` | 4-digit year | `2024` |
| `%y` | 2-digit year | `24` |
| `%M` | Full month name | `January` |
| `%b` | Short month name | `Jan` |
| `%m` | Month number | `01` |
| `%d` | Day number | `05` |
| `%D` | Day with suffix | `5th` |
| `%W` | Weekday name | `Monday` |

---

## ⚠️ Things to Remember

| Mistake | Fix |
|---|---|
| SUBSTRING position starts at 0 | It starts at 1 in MySQL |
| DATEDIFF order matters | `DATEDIFF(end, start)` — end first |
| DATE_ADD syntax | `INTERVAL 30 DAY` not `30 DAYS` |
| Using functions in WHERE slows queries | Index won't be used on function-wrapped columns |

